graph TB
    subgraph "NeMo Guardrails Server"
        direction TB
        FastAPIServer["FastAPI + Uvicorn<br/>Port 8000/TCP"]
        ColangRuntime["Colang Runtime<br/>(v1.0 + v2.x)"]
        GuardrailsLib["Guardrails Library<br/>30+ integrations<br/>(self_check, content_safety,<br/>llama_guard, regex, hallucination, ...)"]
        EmbeddingsEngine["Embeddings Engine<br/>FastEmbed/ONNX +<br/>sentence-transformers"]
        HeaderForwarding["Header Forwarding<br/>(X-Authorization → Authorization)"]

        FastAPIServer -->|invokes| ColangRuntime
        ColangRuntime -->|evaluates rails| GuardrailsLib
        GuardrailsLib -->|semantic similarity| EmbeddingsEngine
        FastAPIServer -->|maps auth headers| HeaderForwarding
    end

    subgraph "API Surface (Port 8000)"
        ChatEndpoint["/v1/chat/completions<br/>POST"]
        ChecksEndpoint["/v1/guardrail/checks<br/>POST (fork-specific)"]
        ChecksV1["/v1/checks<br/>POST (Colang 1.0)"]
        ConfigsEndpoint["/v1/rails/configs<br/>GET"]
        ModelsEndpoint["/v1/models<br/>GET"]
        HealthEndpoint["/v1/health + /healthz<br/>GET"]
    end

    subgraph "Optional Components"
        ActionsServer["Actions Server<br/>Port 8001/TCP<br/>(remote action execution)"]
        CLI["CLI (nemoguardrails)<br/>chat, server, eval, convert"]
        RedisStore["Redis DataStore<br/>(thread persistence)"]
    end

    Client[Client Application] -->|OpenAI-compatible API| ChatEndpoint
    Client -->|per-message rail eval| ChecksEndpoint
    Client -->|list configs| ConfigsEndpoint

    ChatEndpoint --> FastAPIServer
    ChecksEndpoint --> FastAPIServer
    ChecksV1 --> FastAPIServer
    ConfigsEndpoint --> FastAPIServer
    ModelsEndpoint --> FastAPIServer
    HealthEndpoint --> FastAPIServer

    HeaderForwarding -->|Bearer Token| UpstreamLLM["Upstream LLM Server<br/>(vLLM / NIM / OpenAI)"]
    FastAPIServer -.->|optional| RedisStore
    FastAPIServer -->|config files| ConfigFS["Guardrails Config<br/>/app/config/{CONFIG_ID}/"]
    EmbeddingsEngine -->|loads| PreCachedModels["Pre-cached ML Models<br/>(all-MiniLM-L6-v2)"]

    %% Platform Auth
    PlatformAuth["kube-rbac-proxy<br/>(platform auth sidecar)"] -->|authenticated requests| Client

